
>> Product := Chinhu nyowani.
Product kana-zvasvika: ['a'] ita: { :price
	Zvabuda nyora: ['cost ']+ price.
}.
>> Apples := Product nyowani.
Zvabuda nyora: ['Apples cost: '].
Apples a 60.
Zvabuda nyora: [' cent a piece.'].


Nhamba kana-zvasvika: ['X'] ita: { :b
	b × pachako. 
}.
7 X { :i Zvabuda nyora: i. }.
